    "sections": {
        "description": "Fitness Cardio is a sleek and powerful WordPress theme designed for gyms, personal trainers, and fitness enthusiasts. Featuring a modern, fully responsive design, it includes class scheduling, trainer profiles, workout plans, and WooCommerce integration for online sales. Optimized for speed and SEO, this theme ensures a seamless user experience across all devices. With easy customization and drag-and-drop page builders, Fitness Cardio makes it effortless to create a professional and engaging fitness website."
